WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.333
Open the installer and choose your official Gen One, three point ten point one updater.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:11.708
Prepare installation files verifies the updater and gets your recovery files ready on the computer.

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:18.750
With the Live in stock three point ten point one, use Developer Mode and its local address for the read-only check.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:25.708
Select your removable FAT thirty-two key and confirm your backup. The installer does not format it.

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:32.917
Prepare USB key copies and verifies XMP while preserving existing projects and samples. Wait for completion.

00:00:32.917 --> 00:00:37.458
Safely eject the key. Keep it out of the Live until the loader is installed.
